    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82579" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιχωρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺ περιχώρει λαβὼν τὴν χέρνιβα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					958
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν Ἑλλάδα</span>
				Thalesap.<i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				1.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
