				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be transferred to, come to in succession</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ βασιληΐη π. ἐς Δαρεῖον</span>”
