					Hdt.
					1.210
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὀργὴ π. ἐς τό τινων μίασμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					40.49
				</span></i>
			.</div>
